## Card Motion & Animation ✅ (Phase 3)

**Feasibility: yes.** React Native + Reanimated can animate cards from hand → table → collected pile with layout-measured coordinates. The blocker today is **architecture**, not graphics: `turnEngine` applies play + flip + collect in a **single reducer update**, so the UI only sees the end state.

### Current vs target

| Today | Target |
|-------|--------|
| Tap hand card → board instantly shows final hand, table, collected | Same logic, but UI **plays each step** before showing the next state |
| AI turn jumps after delay | AI uses the **same animation queue** as human (mirrored layout for top player); **1200ms** pre-turn pause |
| Sounds fire from `soundEffects` batch after state change | Sounds/haptics fire **per animation step** (play → flip → collect) |

### Turn choreography (human & AI)

Each turn follows real Go-Stop order. Animations should match this sequence:

```
1. PLAY   — card leaves hand, slides onto table (empty slot or match position)
2. FLIP   — top deck card lifts, flips face-up, lands on table
3. RESOLVE — one of:
   · COLLECT — matched set slides to that player's CollectedPileView
   · STACK (뻑) — flip lands on pair, then bounce merge on table
   · TABLE   — no match; both cards remain on table
```

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Hand
  participant Table
  participant Deck
  participant Pile
  Hand->>Table: play (slide)
  Deck->>Table: flip (lift + rotate)
  alt match
    Table->>Pile: collect (slide + fade)
    Deck->>Pile: collect if flip matched
  else 뻑
    Deck->>Table: stack on pair
  end
```

### Implementation approach (no engine rewrite required)

Keep **domain rules** in `turnEngine.ts`; add a thin **presentation layer**:

| Piece | Role |
|-------|------|
| `TurnStep` type | `playHand`, `flipDeck`, `collect` (+ `sourceTableIndex`, `sourceTableCardId`), `stack` (+ `targetTableCardId`), `pause` — slot hints by pile face card id |
| `buildTurnSteps(before, after)` or phased engine calls | Derive animation steps from state diff, or split `playHandCard` into apply-play → apply-flip → apply-collect |
| `AnimationController` hook | Queue steps, `isAnimating` locks input, runs Reanimated transitions |
| `FlyingCard` overlay | Absolute-positioned `CardView` above board; not tied to ScrollView layout during flight |
| Layout anchors | Hand slots by card id; **table piles by face `table-card-{cardId}`**; empty slot `table-slot-{index}`; **invisible deck** anchor in table grid; collected tray; `remeasureAll()` before each step and after scroll |
| `game.tsx` | Renders logical board from **committed** state; overlay shows **in-flight** cards until step completes |

**Recommended:** phased commits inside `useMatgoGame` — reducer actions `PLAY_HAND`, `FLIP_DECK`, `COLLECT` — so animation hooks between dispatches. Alternative: single dispatch + `buildTurnSteps(prev, next)` replay (less engine change, harder to sync mid-turn choices).

### Animation catalog

| Step | Motion | Timing | Notes |
|------|--------|--------|-------|
| **Play hand** | Hand anchor → **matched pile or empty slot**; **face-up in flight** (AI + human) | speed-tuned (`gameSpeed`) | `targetTableCardId` + `resolveTableAnchor`; not `tableCenter` |
| **Pause before collect** | Hold on table | speed-tuned | After play when hand match collects; before flip-match collect |
| **Flip deck** | Invisible deck anchor → **target pile or empty slot**; **face-up in flight** (no flip-on-arrival) | speed-tuned | Skips premature table add when landing on existing pile (뻑/collect) |
| **Collect** | Table pile anchor → collected tray | speed-tuned | `sourceTableCardId` for stable origin when indices shift mid-turn |
| **뻑 stack** | Flip to pair, then **spring bounce** at pile | `stack` timing (~140–200ms) | `FlyingCard.bounceOnArrival`; no collect flight |
| **No match** | Play + flip land on table only | — | Highlight optional |
| **AI pre-turn** | — | **1200ms** | `AI_TURN_DELAY_MS` before `AI_TURN` dispatch |

Use `withSpring` for land; `withTiming` for flight. Collected pile: cards shrink slightly into tray on arrival (matches `pile` size).

### Human vs AI

- **Same step types** — only anchor positions differ (seat 0 bottom, seat 1 top).
- **Input lock** — `isAnimating` disables hand/table taps; pending table choice waits until play+flip animations finish, then shows choosable highlights.
- **AI delay** — `AI_TURN_DELAY_MS` (1200ms) pre-turn pause; same animation queue at human-readable speed (toggle “fast AI” later).

### Audio & haptics sync

`GameSoundEffect`: `playCard`, `flipCard` — batched after turn dispatch from `soundEffects` (collect step has no sound). **`yaku`** (`gather-long.mp3`) + success haptic on human yaku. Haptics on collect animation step when enabled.

**AI special moves (흔들기/폭탄/go callout):** haptic only — `isAiSpecialTurn` suppresses play/flip sfx; AI Go callout drops `goStop` sound. Human Go/Stop prompt still plays `goStop` when modal opens.

### New modules (implemented)

```
src/
  audio/
    useGameSounds.ts       # expo-audio players for play / flip / yaku
  game/
    turnSteps.ts           # TurnStep types + buildTurnSteps + applyVisualStep + STEP_TIMING + AI_TURN_DELAY_MS
    yaku.ts                # yaku completion detection for callout
    useTurnAnimation.ts    # animation queue + displayGame + per-step sound/haptics
    useMatgoGame.ts        # yaku queue + enqueue on human turn
  components/
    FlyingCard.tsx         # Reanimated overlay card
    TurnAnimationOverlay.tsx
    YakuCalloutOverlay.tsx # yaku celebration overlay
    LayoutAnchor.tsx       # onLayout anchor registry + remeasureAll / subscribeRemeasure
  i18n/
    translations.ts        # EN/KO string catalog (+ game.yaku.*, game.collected, game.yourCollected)
    useTranslation.ts      # hook wired to Settings language
```

### Acceptance criteria (animation slice)

- [x] Playing a hand card visibly moves from hand to table before flip
- [x] Deck flip is visible (face-up flight from invisible deck anchor to table)
- [x] Collection moves cards into CollectedPileView (not instant pile update)
- [x] AI turns use the same motion (mirrored)
- [x] No double-tap or illegal plays while `isAnimating`
- [x] 뻑: flip to pair + stack bounce (`bounceOnArrival`); no collect flight
- [x] Sounds align with play and flip animation steps (human + normal AI turns)
- [x] Collect/play/flip flights use **card-id table anchors** (`targetTableCardId` / `sourceTableCardId`) — fixes index drift (e.g. 1·11·12월 광 flying to leftmost pile)
- [x] Anchors remeasured before each step and after board scroll (accurate paths on 3P layout)

### Phase placement

**Phase 3 — Polish** (after Phase 2 scoring / Go/Stop). Can land incrementally: (1) play only, (2) + flip, (3) + collect, (4) AI parity.

