## Android build troubleshooting

If Gradle fails with a stale autolinking path (e.g. `go-stop-game/node_modules/...` after repo rename):

```bash
rm -rf android/build android/.gradle android/app/.cxx
npx expo prebuild --platform android --no-install
npm run android:device
```

`android/build/generated/autolinking/autolinking.json` is gitignored — regenerate instead of hand-editing. After prebuild, re-apply any intentional `android/app/build.gradle` customizations (e.g. `Hwatu-` APK/AAB rename) if Expo cleared them.

